	70	Integrate with Spring AI Since you’re bypassing the similaritySearch method, you’ll need to handle the result processing manually. If you want to integrate this with Spring AI’s Document objects, you can convert the Document results into org.springframework.ai.document.Document instances. Example conversion: import org.springframework.ai.document.Document;
	71	
	72	List springAiDocuments = results.stream()
	73	    .map(doc -> new Document(
	74	        doc.getString("content"),
	75	        (Map) doc.get("metadata")
	76	    ))
	77	    .collect(Collectors.toList());
